  "description": {
   "text": "Shapeshift: Mustard Jelly\nThe caster becomes a mustard jelly: Strength 14, Dexterity 9, the caster's own Armor Class, 1 attack per round at up to 15 feet, 5d4 crushing damage as a +3 weapon. A hit slows the target for 200 seconds unless it saves vs. Polymorph at -2, and poisons it for 30 seconds unless it saves vs. Death at +2. The jelly moves faster, has 125% Magic Resistance, 100% resistance to electricity and piercing damage, 85% to missiles, 50% to cold and 30% to slashing and crushing damage, and is immune to non-magical weapons, poison, charm, confusion, fear, sleep, hold, stun, petrification, level drain and death magic, to Cloudkill, Chaos, Confusion, Hold Person, Nature's Beauty and swarms. No spells or items can be used in this form."
